# Files in THIS REPO FOLDER that must not be pushed by a raw `clasp push`.
#
# NOTICE 2026-09-18 (Gary): Credentials.js is deliberately NOT listed here.
# `clasp push` runs projects.updateContent, which REPLACES the project's remote file
# set: any file that is not pushed is DELETED from the live project. Ignoring the
# accessor is therefore exactly what let a push delete it (incidents 2026-08-21 and
# 2026-09-06 in this project -> `ReferenceError: setApiKeys is not defined` on @HEAD).
# The SECRET-FREE Credentials.js is tracked in git and pushed like any other source;
# real secrets live in Script Properties (Project Settings -> Script properties).
#
# Repo-only files (NOT part of the live project):
manifest.json
Credentials.sample.js
